  "released": {
    "date": "2001-07-07"
  },
  "description": {
    "text": "A half deck released in Japan on 7 July 2001 for the cinema release of the fourth Pokémon film, Celebi: The Voice of the Forest; English sources call it the Tyranitar Half Deck. It holds twelve Owner's Pokémon from the Pokémon VS expansion, such as Falkner's Fearow, Clair's Mantine and Karen's Rapidash, with Rocket's Tyranitar, four Trainers and basic Energy, and came with a rulebook, damage and status counters and a Celebi coin.\n\nA slightly altered version was handed to the players of the 2001 Tropical Mega Battle, with Tropical Breeze in place of Rocket's Tyranitar and the Darkness Energy."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A blue \"VS\" logo at the bottom left, and a number out of 141"
  },
